attempts.raw:
{
  "text": "To the gathered townsfolk, we bid farewell to the Willow Span, that steadfast arch of weathered timber, which has borne forty winters with quiet grace. Its boards, kissed by rain and sun, once bore market baskets heavy with harvest and the light steps of brides. Now, in stillness, we hear only the echo of footsteps in the wood—ghosts of laughter, of love, of lives crossed in quiet trust. May its memory hold as firm as its beams once did, and may we carry its quiet strength in our own steps forward."
}

